    {
      "criterion_index": 1,
      "evidence": [
        "Original independently approved T02 R02 evidence supplies historical support for unchanged LPAC isolation and audited permission denial. No worker image, guardian, broker, credentials, grant/trust authority or permissions changed. This packet does not reuse an old native result as fresh proof.",
        "Fresh current execution contains 65 passing worker/repository/dispatch/broker/consent cases. The real source-Core create child executes the signed zero-capability LPAC sample twice, persists two protected pages with predecessor/provenance/rights checks, denies a forged cursor before egress, refuses malformed output and cancels active broker work without result publication. Current source uses real Windows DPAPI, SQLCipher and human trust/enable/consent with a test-only verified signed-worker adapter and synthetic publisher/provider HTTP. Named case and create-phase facts are authenticated by current-execution-evidence-authentication; all child logs and runtime input identities are retained below."
      ]
    },
    {
      "criterion_index": 2,
      "evidence": [
        "The due-heartbeat publication regression was committed and failed before product edits at 2d65298f: 15 cases, exactly one expected publication assertion failure and no setup errors. Current execution passes all 16 worker submission cases, including that exact regression plus durable cancellation, global stop, project-only stop and expired lease immediately at publication. The additional 49 current repository/dispatch/broker/consent cases also pass.",
        "Polling and queue heartbeat now run before acquiring the publication writer; the in-writer callback reads only process/project stop flags. The repository retains exact claim capability, live running lease, durable cancellation and current grant/consent/predecessor checks inside its atomic writer. No test assertion or security fence was weakened. Full post-crash project reopen is not proven by this correction; the preserved native failure belongs to pending S05 integration, which cannot be marked complete."
      ]
    },
    {
      "criterion_index": 3,
      "evidence": [
        "The exact base-to-candidate diff has only the two spec-admitted product/test paths and the claim/generated planning records. Ruff format/lint and mypy pass. Canonical taskctl ledger validation passes. The product repair changes neither schema/migration, actors, audit/rights, LPAC, approved UX nor automation/harness source.",
        "The joined restart attempt was executed as planned but failed on the foreign project session lock retained by intentional os._exit(0). Read-only observation confirms RO-CORE-PROJECT-ALREADY-OPEN and preserves its exact lock. Approved CAP-02.S01 explicitly requires reviewed stale-lock recovery; this packet does not approve breaking that lock or expanding lifecycle authority. C11 closes only the demonstrated nested-heartbeat publication defect; separate S05 restart/recovery, independent slice review and fresh W2/release gates remain required."
      ]
    }
